{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14266","headline":"洛下闲居夜晴观雪寄四远诸兄弟 · 窦牟","name":"洛下闲居夜晴观雪寄四远诸兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪月相辉云四开，终风助冻不扬埃。\n万重琼树宫中接，一直银河天上来。\n荆楚岁时知染翰，湘吴醇酎忆衔桮。\n强题缣素无颜色，鸿雁南飞早晚回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}